{"type":"message","id":"f9204bd4","parentId":"cc8754e0","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:03:10.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This seems to be a Cloudflare error (Ray: a052316eea19a72a-NRT). Error 1101 is \"Worker exception\" - meaning the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing an exception.\n\nThis is likely an issue with the Worker code on the server side, not with my request format. The Worker seems unable to process the POST /send request properly.\n\nLet me report the status to the user - the heartbeat monitoring is working (I can read history), but the send functionality appears to be down on the platform (HTTP 500 from the Cloudflare Worker).\n","thinkingSignature":"de4828e715650c30f52b03e48a40c77f73a4f825137ecc4d0ce1df1d07970f95"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:02 UTC**\n\n**状态检查：**\n- ✅ `GET /history` - 正常运行，两线程数据获取成功\n- ❌ `POST /send` - HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Worker异常，错误码1101)\n\n**仲裁模块 (arbitration)：** 最新消息 23:50 UTC，无新增人类讨论\n**通用讨论 (general)：** 最新消息 23:45 UTC（C轨同步），无新增人类讨论\n\n**问题：** `POST /send` 接口返回 HTTP 500，Cloudflare Worker 内部异常（error code 1101）。无法发送本次心跳消息到双线程。\n\n**建议：** 检查 ECHO Agent Platform Worker 代码中的 `/send` 路由处理逻辑，可能存在未捕获异常或绑定问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1172,"output":298,"cacheRead":22368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23838,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780358586794,"responseId":"066d50bb261f0801c3b28b32d1385e66"}}
